---
import Container from "../ui/Container.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="px-4 py-20 md:px-8">
  <Container>
    <h2 class="mb-12 text-3xl font-bold">
      About <span class="accent-red">Me</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="order-1">
        <figure class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-sm md:max-w-md">
          <div
            class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 shadow-2xl shadow-black/20"
          >
            <img
              src="/assets/sam_riddle.jpg"
              alt="Sam Riddle"
              class="aspect-[4/5] h-full w-full object-cover"
              style="object-position: 68% top;"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption
            class="mt-4 border-l-2 border-[var(--color-accent)] pl-4 md:absolute md:top-full md:right-0 md:left-0"
          >
            <p class="font-medium">Sam Riddle</p>
            <p class="text-secondary text-sm">
              The University of Alabama, 2024
            </p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="order-2">
        <p class="text-secondary mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          I'm currently building academic technology at QuantHub, where I work
          on software that supports how students learn skills and how educators
          teach them. I see that work as part of a broader mission to learn new
          things and help people get better at what they do.
        </p>

        <p class="text-secondary mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          I studied Management Information Systems, Operations Management, and
          Decision Analytics at The University of Alabama. That background
          helped me pursue my interests in how work flows, how decisions get
          made, and how small efforts compound to make big differences.
        </p>

        <p class="text-secondary mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          I'm a quick learner with a strong attention to detail, but the
          qualities I value most are diligence, authenticity, and reliability. I
          want to do excellent work, but I also want to be the kind of person
          people trust and enjoy working with.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
